storicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"明示子孫與弟稱保存；排行只記相對先後，不補確切序號、同母或中間父系。從弟與弟分存，不強行統一親等。 前段田儋明示姓名與後段田儋子市承接，保留兩段錨點。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","context":{"kind":"adjacent_paragraphs","paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-094-tiandan:p003","c-shiji-094-tiandan:p004"]}}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji094-002","person_id":"cbr-p005225","title":"齊王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan","source_id":"s-shiji-094-tiandan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan:p002","quote":"陳涉之初起王楚也，使周市略定魏地，北至狄，狄城守。田儋詳為縛其奴，從少年之廷，欲謁殺奴。見狄令，因擊殺令，而召豪吏子弟曰：「諸侯皆反秦自立，齊，古之建國，儋，田氏，當王。」遂自立為齊王，發兵以擊周市。周市軍還去，田儋因率兵東略定齊地。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji094-002:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan:p002","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"齊王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan:m002-0077","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan","source_id":"s-shiji-094-tiandan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan:p002","quote":"陳涉之初起王楚也，使周市略定魏地，北至狄，狄城守。田儋詳為縛其奴，從少年之廷，欲謁殺奴。見狄令，因擊殺令，而召豪吏子弟曰：「諸侯皆反秦自立，齊，古之建國，儋，田氏，當王。」遂自立為齊王，發兵以擊周市。周市軍還去，田儋因率兵東略定齊地。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"實授、自立、用稱分存；擬封蒯通安期生及拒受、田橫來大者王小者侯均不作已授。王膠東保留原稱王，不造正文未見膠東王字串；死亡被虜亡走不自動終止爵位。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-shiji094-001","person_id":"cbr-p005225","relation":"biographical_origin","place":{"source_name":"狄","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan","source_id":"s-shiji-094-tiandan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-094-tiandan:p001","quote":"田儋者，狄人也，故齊王田氏族也。儋從弟田榮，榮弟田橫，皆豪，宗彊，能得人。"}],"source_term":"狄人也","interpretation_note":"傳首所述出身地與明示死亡地分存，不推今日行政區、制度化籍貫、出生或葬地。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false},{"id":"pa-shiji094-002","person_id":"cbr-p005225","relat